# Environment variables
# Every dotenv variant is ignored, including files pulled from a provider
# (e.g. `vercel env pull some-file`), which the explicit list below used to
# miss — a pulled file carries APP_TOKEN and GEMINI_API_KEY in cleartext.
# .env.example is the one that must stay tracked.
.env*
!.env.example

